[F]I [Dm]walk [Am]in [Gm]danger [F]all [G7]the [C]way; [F]The [C7]thought [F]shall [Gm7]ne[C]ver leave me
That [Dm]Sa[F]tan, [Gm7]who has [A]marked [Dm]his [A]prey, [F]Is [Bb]plot[F7]ting [Bb]to [C]de[F]ceive [C]me.
